@CRM_Morcaffein.api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5035

GET {{CRM_Morcaffein.api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Reach master -> resolve tenant A -> hit Tenant A's DB
GET http://localhost:5035/test-tenant/3
Accept: application/json
###

### SuperAdmin login
# @name saLogin
POST http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### List companies
GET http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### List plans
GET http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Tenant A — full seed
POST http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/dev/seed

### Tenant B — minimal seed
POST http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/2/dev/seed?customers=10&orders=30

### Tenant C — minimal seed
POST http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/3/dev/seed?customers=10&orders=30

### List employees
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### List employees in Tenant A
GET http://localhost:5035/api/tenant/1/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###

POST http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies/1/assign-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": 3,
  "termsAcceptedBy": "Platform Operator"
}

###

### List subscriptions for Company 1
GET http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies/1/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Upgrade to Full (assign Basic first, then Full, to see the history)
POST http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies/1/assign-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": 1,
  "termsAcceptedBy": "Platform Operator"
}

###

POST http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies/1/assign-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": 3,
  "termsAcceptedBy": "Platform Operator"
}

###

### Now subscriptions should show 3 rows: Full (initial), Basic (superseded), Full (current)
GET http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/companies/1/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}

